# type(scope): summary
# Types: feat, fix, security, refactor, docs, test, build, ci, chore
# Imperative; no final period; prefer <50, maximum about 72 characters.
#
# After a blank line explain what changed and why.
# Wrap body lines at 72 characters. Include only tests actually performed.
# One logical change per commit. No secrets or invented issue numbers.
# Do not list AI tools as Co-authored-by.
